  "description": "Local Clerk twin \u2014 a faithful, stateful local Clerk Backend API your real `@clerk/backend` SDK talks to unmodified. Users, sessions, orgs, real signed JWTs + a JWKS endpoint. Mirror, simulate, and fork. Built on @volter/world-core.",
  "keywords": [
    "twin",
    "local",
    "mock",
    "mirror",
    "simulator",
    "fixtures",
    "testing",
    "sdk",
    "api",
    "localstack",
    "clerk",
    "auth",
    "jwt",
    "jwks"
  ],
  "author": "Volter (https://github.com/volter-ai)",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "files": [
    "src",
    "journeys",
    "spec",
    "vendor",
    "fapi",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "!**/*.test.ts",
    "!**/*.test.tsx",
    "dist",
    "generated"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/volter-ai/twin-packs-open.git",
    "directory": "clerk"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/volter-ai/twin-packs-open/tree/main/clerk#readme",
